						<td align="right" bgcolor="#6E94B7" class="titlebg" nowrap="nowrap"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size="2">&nbsp;on: <b>Today</b> at 06:51:26pm&nbsp;</font></td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size="2">Started by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=viewprofile;user=Kinladar">Kinladar</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=viewprofile;user=Delfino+Soulreaver">Delfino Soulreaver</a></font></td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#F8F8F8" valign="top" height="40" class="windowbg2">I&#039;ve only scouted through Natimbi, Port zone from Nedaria and zone that the boat city takes you to, and so far it&#039;s an ok zone.&nbsp; There is plenty of mobs to fight, but a lot of these mobs run super fast.&nbsp; I rode away on my horse from some and they were still on me when i stoped to take a quick swim.<br /><br />Hopefully I will be able to explore the other zones, but for the most part it seems like a must to take a group along with you at all times.</td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="windowbg"><font size="2">
						&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=post;threadid=637;start=5;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/reply_sm.gif" alt="Reply" title="Reply" border="0" /></a> <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=post;threadid=637;quote=5452;title=Post+reply;sesc=1fb0d3d1cf3bb3a7d22166ba07f07362"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a> <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=notify;threadid=637;start=5"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/notify_sm.gif" alt="Notify of replies" title="Notify of replies" border="0" /></a>
