						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size="2">Started by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=viewprofile;user=Kinladar">Kinladar</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=viewprofile;user=chidder">chidder</a></font></td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#F8F8F8" valign="top" height="40" class="windowbg2">First of all we have had a Second Xenogy clear<br /><br /><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><font size="1"><b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=display;board=1;threadid=320;start=540#msg5437">Quote from: Kinladar on <b>Today</b> at 08:28:14am</a></b></font></td></tr></table><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#000000"><tr><td><table border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="2" width="100%"><tr><td class="quote">Conviction may not be the leader in racing, but they obviously have the edge in being able to carry out the killing of a target better than Forsaken.<br /><br />Conviction is a 2-3 month old guild. They still have to learn how to be pricks yet.<br /></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>And you expect a board were the lead mod turns to direct flaming because of age old guild conflicts to do well. In what way is Conviction able to carry out killing of a target better than forsaken? .&nbsp; I don&#039;t see Conviction waving there penixs saying there better than us so why are you trying to do it for them.&nbsp; I mean honestly I&#039;m not bashing your guild. I&#039;m not bashing you as a player, but I am bashing you a someone who&#039;s trying to run a respectable forum here.&nbsp; <br /><br />I will mention the idea of killing a the same mobs does not make you level with guild. Even when we had the same mobs downed as FoT it did not make us even. They still had months of farming on us and pratice. Anyone who said they we were even was wrong.<br /><br />posts like &quot; I said before Conviction&gt;Forsaken. &quot; -Fignutn - are not though ot and are just people bringing conflects into the forum.<br /><br />Now I do want to see a good RN forum... but not if people are like this isn&#039;t it time to drop this conflict?</td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="windowbg"><font size="2">
						&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=post;threadid=320;start=551;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/reply_sm.gif" alt="Reply" title="Reply" border="0" /></a> <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=post;threadid=320;quote=5451;title=Post+reply;sesc=1fb0d3d1cf3bb3a7d22166ba07f07362"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a> <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=notify;threadid=320;start=551"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/notify_sm.gif" alt="Notify of replies" title="Notify of replies" border="0" /></a>
						</font></td>
