						<td width="75%" bgcolor="#6E94B7" class="titlebg"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size="2"><b>&nbsp;General Category / General Discussion / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=display;threadid=320;start=msg5450#msg5450" style="color: #FFFFFF">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b></font></td>
						<td align="right" bgcolor="#6E94B7" class="titlebg" nowrap="nowrap"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size="2">&nbsp;on: <b>Today</b> at 05:44:13pm&nbsp;</font></td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size="2">Started by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=viewprofile;user=Kinladar">Kinladar</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=viewprofile;user=Memadil">Memadil</a></font></td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#F8F8F8" valign="top" height="40" class="windowbg2">When Conviction kills Xegony a 2nd time i would put them above Forsaken, seeing as i have not heard of Forsaken killing Xegony for a 2nd time.&nbsp; Please correct me if this is wrong.<br /><br />Gratz big time conviction!</td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="windowbg"><font size="2">
						&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=post;threadid=320;start=551;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/reply_sm.gif" alt="Reply" title="Reply" border="0" /></a> <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=post;threadid=320;quote=5450;title=Post+reply;sesc=1fb0d3d1cf3bb3a7d22166ba07f07362"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a> <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=notify;threadid=320;start=551"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/notify_sm.gif" alt="Notify of replies" title="Notify of replies" border="0" /></a>
						</font></td>
