					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size="2">Started by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=viewprofile;user=Kinladar">Kinladar</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=viewprofile;user=Gnos">Gnos</a></font></td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#F8F8F8" valign="top" height="40" class="windowbg2">Wouldn&#039;t it be easier to move away from DX and go to OpenGL so that they can open the market directly to Linux users?</td>
					</tr><tr>
						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="windowbg"><font size="2">
						&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=post;threadid=639;start=1;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/reply_sm.gif" alt="Reply" title="Reply" border="0" /></a> <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=post;threadid=639;quote=5448;title=Post+reply;sesc=1fb0d3d1cf3bb3a7d22166ba07f07362"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a> <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1;action=notify;threadid=639;start=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/notify_sm.gif" alt="Notify of replies" title="Notify of replies" border="0" /></a>
						</font></td>
					</tr>
				</table><br />
				<table border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="1" bgcolor="#6394BD" class="bordercolor">
					<tr>
